  "description": "500W Brushless Motor\n\nThe Lankeleisi ES500PRO is equipped with a 500W high-speed brushless motor that minimizes energy loss and enhances overall riding range. With its strong 500W output, tackling city routes and climbing steep urban roads becomes effortless.\n\n48V 14.5Ah Lithium Battery\n\nThe Lankeleisi ES500PRO is powered by a 48V 14.5Ah removable Li-ion battery built with 18650 cells, offering up to 130 km of range in pedal-assist mode. The battery is securely housed inside the frame to reduce the risk of short circuits, providing a safer and more dependable riding experience.\n\nFront Fork Suspension\n\nThe Lankeleisi ES500PRO features an adjustable aluminum front fork that absorbs shocks and vibrations from uneven city roads, ensuring a comfortable and smooth ride. Its adjustable suspension allows you to adapt to various road conditions, improving overall riding comfort.\n\nLCD Color Display\n\nColour Backlight Display to keep track of speed, mileage, power and more.",
